362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (  - DHCP     - WSUS     - ASREQRoasting - NetNTLM relay      - SMB     - MSSQL - ASREPRoasting  - Bruteforcing      - Password spraying     - Pre-authentication - Vulnerabilities      - Proxyshell     - Proxylogon     - Eternalblue     - SMBGhost     - Zerologon\(unauthenticated version\)     - Petitpotam\(unauthenticated version\))
/E (  - DHCP     - WSUS     - ASREQRoasting - NetNTLM relay      - SMB     - MSSQL - ASREPRoasting  - Bruteforcing      - Password spraying     - Pre-authentication - Vulnerabilities      - Proxyshell     - Proxylogon     - Eternalblue     - SMBGhost     - Zerologon\(unauthenticated version\)     - Petitpotam\(unauthenticated version\))
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
