<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (How to Perform LLMNR/NBTNS poisoning via SMB)
/E (How to Perform LLMNR/NBTNS poisoning via SMB)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
487 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (so performing this attack will require us to set up Responder , which will help us to send the rouge replies to the Vitim. Just run it on the network interface you want your rouge replies to go.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
